        "Pour water over the head three times, then over the right shoulder three times, then the left, and rub the whole body." to "Ku shub biyo madaxa saddex jeer, ka dibna garabka midig saddex jeer, ka dibna bidix, oo xoqin jirka oo dhan.",
        "Three acts are Fard: rinsing the whole mouth, rinsing the nose up to the soft part, and water reaching every part of the body so that not a hair's breadth stays dry." to "Saddex fal waa Fard: luqluqashada afka oo dhan, luqluqashada sanka ilaa qaybta jilicsan, iyo biyaha oo gaadha qayb kasta oo jidhka ka mid ah si aanay timaha ballaadhkoodu u engegin.",
