        "It is Wajib when a Wajib is missed, delayed or repeated by mistake — for example forgetting the first sitting or the Qunut. In the final sitting recite the Tashahhud, give one salam to the right, make two sajdahs, then sit and recite the Tashahhud, Durood and dua again and end with both salams." to "Waa Wajib marka Wajib la waayo, dib u dhigo ama lagu celiyo si qalad ah - tusaale ahaan illoobay fadhiga hore ama Qunut. Fadhiga u dambeeya akhri Tashaxud, hal salaan midigta ka dhig, laba sajadood samee, dabadeed fadhiiso oo akhri Tashaxud, Durood iyo ducaba mar labaad ku dhammee labada salaam.",
