        "Along with making them up, repent sincerely for having missed them." to "Markaad sameysid iyaga, si daacad ah uga toobad seegay iyaga.",
        "Fard and Witr are made up; Sunnah prayers are not, except the Sunnah of Fajr when made up with its Fard before midday. Qaza is prayed at any time except the three forbidden times." to "Fard iyo Witr ayaa ka kooban; Salaadda sunnada ah maaha, marka laga reebo Sunnada Fajarka marka lagu daro Fardkeeda ka hor duhurnimada. Qaza waxa la tukadaa wakhti kasta marka laga reebo saddexda wakhti ee xaaraanta ah.",
